test_delaunay -- the Delaunay check against exact arithmetic (Nov 2026)
=======================================================================

QUICK START

  sh run_delaunay_tests.sh [path-to-del_vor]   16 runs, about 3 s
  open summary.html

WHAT IS TESTED

  For each line of cases.txt:

  del_vor -avs MESH -check_only on -violations NAME.vtu \
          -report NAME.report EXTRA

  on the meshes of the other suites (lanl/voronoi's three, LaGriT's
  test_poisson_2d and _3d) and on meshes made by
  make_delaunay_inputs.py:

  flip2d      poi2d_01 with 5 interior edges flipped: 5 violations
  flip3d      poi3d_01 with three 2-3 flips: 9 violations
  kuhn        a 4 x 3 x 3 grid of cubes, 6 tets each: 216 ties
  near_tie    one vertex 1e-6 off the common circle: delta/L = -5e-7,
              caught with the default delaunay_tol 1e-10 and accepted
              with delaunay_tol 1e-5
  utm         poi3d_01 moved to UTM-size coordinates

  Two more cases run without check_only: flip2d_stor must stop
  without writing the .stor; kuhn_stor must write it.

WHAT IS CHECKED (check_delaunay.py, ../exact_check.py)

  The expected answers are not stored: exact_check.py scales the
  coordinates to integers by a power of 2 and finds every facet's
  sign with exact rational arithmetic.

  exit         1 if some facet has delta/L < -tol (exactly
               computed), else 0, with check_only or without
  counts       interior (and interface) facets, ties, violations,
               boundary facets, boundary circumcenters outside, all
               equal to the exact numbers
  facets       the violations file lists exactly the facets the exact
               test flags, each with the right kind (1 violation,
               2 across an interface, 3 boundary circumcenter
               outside); no file when nothing is flagged
  values       each flagged facet's delta/L (or s/L) within 1e-7 of
               the exact value
  worst        the report's smallest delta/L equals the exact one
               (to the 5 digits it is printed with)
  stor         flip2d_stor writes no .stor; kuhn_stor writes one
               whose volumes add up to 36

  MEASURED: the histogram of delta/L; the smallest real (non-tie)
  value found was 4.1e-5 in 3D and 1.4e-4 in 2D, while true ties
  computed to at most 2.7e-16. This is why delaunay_tol is 1e-10.

PICTURES (logs/)

  NAME.svg  the mesh (2D: every edge; 3D: the boundary faces'
            edges); red: not Delaunay; orange: boundary circumcenter
            outside. Small 2D meshes also show each triangle's
            circumcircle (dashed) and the vertex numbers.

FILES

  run_delaunay_tests.sh     runner (work/, logs/)
  make_delaunay_inputs.py   the generated meshes
  check_delaunay.py         checks, pictures, summary.html
  cases.txt                 name | mesh | extra arguments | what it does
